West said: &#x201C;Basketball has been such a big part of my life, and I&#x2019;m grateful for the platform and opportunities it&#x2019;s given me. As I step into filmmaking, I&#x2019;m excited to expand that impact through storytelling and spark meaningful conversations. The Neighbor is a project I&#x2019;m proud to be part of, and as production continues, I look forward to collaborating with our talented team to bring this story to life and create something audiences will remember.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#x201C; The Neighbor represents an exciting evolution in my career as a filmmaker, marking my first psychological thriller and third major production in less than a year,&#x201D; added director and executive producer Kyle Scott. &#x201C;Through my collaboration with David M. West, I&#x2019;m focused on building a diverse slate of films that challenge convention, transcend cultural and geographical boundaries, and deliver powerful storytelling to audiences around the world. Great cinema has no borders.&#x201D;

